{"id":1086620,"shortDescription":"Selfloss es un juego de aventuras ambientado en un mundo de folclore eslavo e islandés. Como jugador, asumes el papel de un anciano con un báculo mágico que vaga por mares y lagos combatiendo a criaturas míticas y ayudando a aquellos que lo necesitan curando sus almas.","developers":["Goodwin Games"],"publishers":["Silver Lining Interactive"],"categories":["Un jugador","Logros de Steam","Compat. total con mando","Se recomienda usar un mando","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"5 SEP 2024","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1738248761","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/ss_74f59af684d79bf44ea93dcfcac86503ff49664a.600x338.jpg?t=1738248761","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/ss_74f59af684d79bf44ea93dcfcac86503ff49664a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738248761"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/ss_9bcead03ac76f5dd9bb5732e08c7371940b6c808.600x338.jpg?t=1738248761","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/ss_9bcead03ac76f5dd9bb5732e08c7371940b6c808.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738248761"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/ss_b0342b44b3b9b1ad8488e6ff08cf723b5b9d07d6.600x338.jpg?t=1738248761","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/ss_b0342b44b3b9b1ad8488e6ff08cf723b5b9d07d6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738248761"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/ss_c6875a2eda2c178919d3241abc5837a59a1275a7.600x338.jpg?t=1738248761","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1086620/ss_c6875a2eda2c178919d3241abc5837a59a1275a7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1738248761"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/